CHAPTER.VERS:
Woe to
Or Ariel: the Hebrew word Ariel signifies the Lion of God, and signifies the Altar, because the altar seemed to devour the sacrifice that was offered to God, as in (Eze_43:16). Ariel, to Ariel, the city [where] David dwelt! add ye year to year;
Your vain confidence in your sacrifices will not last long. let them kill sacrifices.
